==Problem 23==

Lakshmi has <imath>5</imath> round coins of diameter <imath>4</imath> centimeters. She arranges the coins in <imath>2</imath> rows on a table top, as shown below, and wraps an elastic band tightly around them. In centimeters, what will be the length of the band?

[[File:2026 amc 8 q23.png | 450px]]

<imath>\textbf{(A) } 2\pi + 20 \qquad \textbf{(B) } \frac{5}{2}\pi + 20 \qquad \textbf{(C) } 4\pi + 20 \qquad \textbf{(D) } \frac{9}{2}\pi + 20 \qquad \textbf{(E) } 5\pi + 20</imath>

==Solution 1==
